      "writtenOn": "2024-08-13T16:30:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\"old struct member\": does this refer to wgsl struct in the input of PadStruct transform?\n\nYeah, if there\u0027s an existing @size say @size(256), could be problem. Let me add more unittest cases and see if it breaks things.\n\nThanks for pointing this out!",
      "parentUuid": "f8ee48b9_f5911029",
      "revId": "f53e75db4e399dfb106dd58e0a21d41417279d37",
