      "writtenOn": "2024-08-13T19:45:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually I wasn\u0027t worried about that, although it can\u0027t hurt to test. Rounding up should have no effect on the @size attribute, if it\u0027s already required to be rounded up to 16 anyway. Rather, I was wondering if copying the old @size and @align attributes from the old member to the new member might be enough to satisfy the WGSL validation instead of using the value computed by the PadStructs transform.",
      "parentUuid": "10681f2f_f7e69b27",
      "revId": "f53e75db4e399dfb106dd58e0a21d41417279d37",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
