      "message": "- implicit: after pad\n\n```\n// input\nstruct A {\n  x: u32;\n  y: u32;\n  z: u32;\n};\nstruct S {\n  x : u32,\n  @align(16)\n  a : A,\n};\n\n// output: need to add the new size to fit wgsl validation\nstruct A {\n  x: u32;\n  y: u32;\n  z: u32;\n};\nstruct S {\n  x : u32,\n  pad0: u32,\n  pad1: u32,\n  pad2: u32,\n  @align(12), @size(16)\n  a : A,\n};\n```",
