      "writtenOn": "2024-08-14T19:21:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But also, wouldn\u0027t the implicit @size of the resulting struct be 16, even after padding, due to use as uniform? Why do we need to be explicit?\n\n(Actually, same for the @align. The padding should already have ensured it\u0027s falling on @align(16).)",
      "parentUuid": "2f631df5_3e026a1f",
      "revId": "f53e75db4e399dfb106dd58e0a21d41417279d37",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
